<title>USA: FDP Corp in $3 mln South Africa deal.</title>
<headline>FDP Corp in $3 mln South Africa deal.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>FDP Corp said on Thursday it entered into a $3 million licensing agreement with a South African insurance company to install FDP's software product for group pension/annuity administration.</p>
<p>The company said the deal would &quot;make a major contribution&quot; to fiscal 1997 revenues.</p>
<p>	 ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
